{"id":"2a71248c57bfde0f","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed.md","title":"单调性不保证ω阶段稳定","display":"ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed — 单调性不保证ω阶段稳定","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed","aliases":["72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed"],"display":"ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed — 单调性不保证ω阶段稳定","depends_on":["[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","[[72-df-scott-continuity]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local boundary example for Ch.X §4.2; print759–760/PDF771–772","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed — 单调性不保证ω阶段稳定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b5b4d9209f24056\" href=\"?note=6b5b4d9209f24056\" title=\"72-df-scott-continuity\">72-df-scott-continuity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local boundary example for Ch.X §4.2; print759–760/PDF771–772"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>序数采用von Neumann表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\preceq,b,F,S\">\\(D,\\preceq,b,F,S\\)</span> 由下式给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{F,\\theta}\">\\(J_{F,\\theta}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a> 在这个结构上的迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD&amp;:=\\omega+2,\\qquad\\preceq:=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D^2:\\alpha\\le\\beta\\},\\qquad b:=0,\\\\\nF(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\alpha+1,&amp;\\alpha&lt;\\omega,\\\\\\omega+1,&amp;\\omega\\le\\alpha\\le\\omega+1,\\end{cases}\\\\\nS&amp;:=\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F),\\\\\nJ_{F,\\omega}(n)&amp;=n\\quad(n&lt;\\omega),\\qquad J_{F,\\omega}(\\omega)=\\omega,\\\\\nF(\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}S)&amp;=\\omega+1\\ne\\omega=\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}F[S],\\\\\n\\neg\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&amp;,\\qquad J_{F,\\omega+1}(\\omega+1)=\\omega+1=F(\\omega+1).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD&amp;:=\\omega+2,\\qquad\\preceq:=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D^2:\\alpha\\le\\beta\\},\\qquad b:=0,\\\\\nF(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\alpha+1,&amp;\\alpha&lt;\\omega,\\\\\\omega+1,&amp;\\omega\\le\\alpha\\le\\omega+1,\\end{cases}\\\\\nS&amp;:=\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F),\\\\\nJ_{F,\\omega}(n)&amp;=n\\quad(n&lt;\\omega),\\qquad J_{F,\\omega}(\\omega)=\\omega,\\\\\nF(\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}S)&amp;=\\omega+1\\ne\\omega=\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}F[S],\\\\\n\\neg\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&amp;,\\qquad J_{F,\\omega+1}(\\omega+1)=\\omega+1=F(\\omega+1).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>带最大元的此序数链对任意非空子集都有上确界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 在有限处递增，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 处跳到最大元，故单调。有限迭代逐个得到自然数；其上确界为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，但下一步为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega+1\">\\(\\omega+1\\)</span>。这既验证一般超限定理的必要性，也指出直接将单调不动点证明缩为ω步时缺少的连续性。这里是本地边界例，不冒充原书编号例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-scott-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6b5b4d9209f24056","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-scott-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"序数采用von Neumann表示。$D,\\preceq,b,F,S$ 由下式给出；$J_{F,\\theta}$ 使用 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]] 在这个结构上的迭代。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\preceq,b,F,S","display":false},{"tex":"J_{F,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD&:=\\omega+2,\\qquad\\preceq:=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D^2:\\alpha\\le\\beta\\},\\qquad b:=0,\\\\\nF(\\alpha)&:=\\begin{cases}\\alpha+1,&\\alpha<\\omega,\\\\\\omega+1,&\\omega\\le\\alpha\\le\\omega+1,\\end{cases}\\\\\nS&:=\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F),\\\\\nJ_{F,\\omega}(n)&=n\\quad(n<\\omega),\\qquad J_{F,\\omega}(\\omega)=\\omega,\\\\\nF(\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}S)&=\\omega+1\\ne\\omega=\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}F[S],\\\\\n\\neg\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&,\\qquad J_{F,\\omega+1}(\\omega+1)=\\omega+1=F(\\omega+1).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega+1","display":false}],"bytes":2094,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-422","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed|ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed — 单调性不保证ω阶段稳定]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-434","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-456","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed|ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed — 单调性不保证ω阶段稳定]]"},{"id":"f02662d03d2c1226","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：迭代函数及最小稳定序数已在本册独立给出形式构造，新增等式由两个最小前不动点的唯一性成立。要求ω步稳定时，应使用 [[72-thm-kleene-fixed-point]] 的连续性条件；仅单调的边界例见 [[72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed]]"}],"outgoing":["5d95b8963194821b","6b5b4d9209f24056"]}